---
permalink: "/packages/index.html"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Zanzibar Multi-Day Packages & Itineraries</h1>
    <p class="page-meta">Curated 3–7 day packages combining Stone Town culture, marine excursions, beach time, and optional mainland safaris. All include airport transfers, selected tours, and accommodation referral at negotiated rates.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section section-gradient">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Our Packages</span>
        <h2>Curated Multi-Day Experiences</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Hand-crafted itineraries based on what travellers search for. Each package is customizable to your dates and budget.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid package-grid">
        {% for package in packages %}
          <article class="card package-card reveal" data-category="PKG">
            <div class="card-image image-placeholder">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M16 22L32 8L48 22V54H16V22Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 34H48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M32 22V34" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              <button class="card-favorite" aria-label="Add to favorites">♡</button>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <span class="card-badge badge-package">Package</span>
              <h3 class="card-title">{{ package.title }}</h3>
              <p class="card-meta">{{ package.duration }}</p>
              <p class="card-description">{{ package.description }}</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-price">{{ package.price.display }} <span class="price-basis">per person</span></span>
                <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20to%20book%20{{ package.title | urlize }}%20package" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Inquire & Customize</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Popular Frameworks</span>
        <h2>Popular Itinerary Ideas</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">These are sample frameworks — we customize every package to your dates, budget, and interests.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid itinerary-grid">
        <article class="card itinerary-card reveal">
          <div class="card-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M16 22L32 8L48 22V54H16V22Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <div style="position: absolute; top: 1rem; right: 1rem; background: var(--dct-spice); color: var(--dct-charcoal); padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Most Popular</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-package">3 Days / 2 Nights</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Zanzibar Essentials — Culture, Marine & Spice</h3>
            <p class="card-description">Day 1: Arrival + Stone Town tour + Forodhani night market<br>Day 2: Safari Blue Menai Bay + sandbank BBQ<br>Day 3: Spice farm tour + departure transfer</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">From $185 <span class="price-basis">per person</span></span>
              <a href="/packages/zanzibar-essentials-3day/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Full Details</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card itinerary-card reveal">
          <div class="card-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M12 42C12 37.5817 15.5817 34 20 34H44C48.4183 34 52 37.5817 52 42V46H12V42Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-package">4–5 Days</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Beach & Culture Combo</h3>
            <p class="card-description">1 night Stone Town + 3 nights Nungwi/Kendwa + spice tour + Mnemba snorkeling + sunset cruise + airport transfers.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">Custom quote</span>
              <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20a%204-5%20day%20Zanzibar%20beach%20and%20culture%20package" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Request Quote</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card itinerary-card reveal">
          <div class="card-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 10C28.134 10 25 13.134 25 17C25 20.866 28.134 24 32 24C35.866 24 39 20.866 39 17C39 13.134 35.866 10 32 10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M32 24V44" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-package">5–6 Days</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">South Coast Explorer</h3>
            <p class="card-description">Stone Town + Jozani Forest + Kuza Cave & seaweed farm + The Rock Restaurant + Chumbe Island day trip + kitesurfing intro.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">Custom quote</span>
              <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20a%20south%20coast%20Zanzibar%20itinerary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Request Quote</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card itinerary-card reveal">
          <div class="card-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 8L14 30V50H50V30L32 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-safari">7–8 Days</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Ultimate Zanzibar + Mainland Safari</h3>
            <p class="card-description">4 nights Zanzibar (Stone Town + Nungwi) + 3-day Serengeti fly-in safari OR Mikumi/Nyerere day safari + all transfers.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">From $900 <span class="price-basis">per person</span></span>
              <a href="/safaris/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Safari Options</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card itinerary-card reveal">
          <div class="card-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 8C28.6863 8 26 10.6863 26 14V24H18V14C18 8.9706 21.9706 5 26 5C30.0294 5 34 8.9706 34 14V24H38V14C38 10.6863 35.3137 8 32 8ZM26 26V38H38V26H26ZM18 38H46V42H18V38Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-package">7–10 Days</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Honeymoon & Romance Package</h3>
            <p class="card-description">Private dhow cruise + luxury beach resort + spice dinner + Mnemba snorkeling + sunset cruises + couples spa + private transfers.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">Custom quote</span>
              <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20a%20Zanzibar%20honeymoon%20package" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Request Quote</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card itinerary-card reveal">
          <div class="card-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 10C28.134 10 25 13.134 25 17C25 20.866 28.134 24 32 24C35.866 24 39 20.866 39 17C39 13.134 35.866 10 32 10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-package">7–10 Days</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Family Adventure Package</h3>
            <p class="card-description">Stone Town + Prison Island tortoises + Jozani monkeys + family-friendly resort + dolphin watching (ethical) + kid-approved meals.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">Custom quote</span>
              <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20a%20family%20Zanzibar%20package" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Request Quote</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-content reveal">
      <h2>Want a Custom Itinerary?</h2>
      <p>Tell us your travel dates, group size, interests (culture, marine, nature, safari, relaxation), and budget — we'll send a detailed itinerary with transparent pricing within 24 hours.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20a%20custom%20Zanzibar%20itinerary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Request Custom Itinerary</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Mainland</span>
        <h2>Mainland Safaris from Zanzibar</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Fly-in safaris to Serengeti, Ngorongoro, Tarangire, Mikumi, and Nyerere (Selous). 1-day to 7-day options. Licensed mainland operator partners handle all logistics.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="/safaris/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">View Safari Options</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}